#. Tag: title
#: lpd.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generic <acronym>LPD</acronym> Module (&UNIX;)"
msgstr "Generički <acronym>LPD</acronym> Modul (&UNIX;)"

#. Tag: title
#: lpd.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview of Provided Features"
msgstr "Pregled pruženih funkcija"

#. Tag: para
#: lpd.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "Module used by default (on first start for example)."
msgstr "Podrazumijevano korišteni modul (na primjer pri prvom startu)"

#. Tag: para
#: lpd.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Generic module that only allows sending of print jobs. No printer or job "
"management supported. It is made to work on a wide variety of &UNIX; "
"flavors: &Linux;/<acronym>LPR</acronym>, &HP-UX;, Solaris, &IRIX;. It also "
"supports some <application>LPRng</application> extensions (like the absence "
"of continuation character <literal>\\</literal> in <filename>printcap</"
"filename> files)."
msgstr ""
"Generički modul koji omogućava samo slanje zadataka za štampanje. Nijedan "
"štampač ili posao upravljanja nije podržan. Napravljen je da radi na širokom "
"spektru &UNIX; vrsta: &Linux;/<acronym>LPR</acronym>, &HP-UX;, Solaris, "
"&IRIX;. podržava i neka <application>LPRng</application> proširenja (poput "
"nedostatka znaka nastavka <literal>\\</literal> u <filename>printcap</"
"filename> datotekama)."
